# 공개 API 계약: 호출 셸 격리 (기능 001 library_isolation_contract_test, contracts/library-api.md 1절·8절, FR-050~FR-054)
# 호출 셸의 작업 디렉터리·옵션·trap·IFS·접두어 밖 변수 불변은 lib-session 어댑터가 끝에 비교해 op changed가 없음으로 확인한다.
# test_library_source_has_no_exit_word는 scripts/lint.sh 금지 단어 검사로 대체한다(tests/traceability.md).
target lib-session project_path_gateway
layer api
fs file /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.project-path-gateway
fs file /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
content A=a b/*
content MISSING=nope
fs dir /t/루트\sroot/a\sb/*

case isolation-set-eu-caller-is-not-terminated
caller-set -eu
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call eval project_path_gateway_get\sNOPE\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'get=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval project_path_gateway_verify\s>/dev/null\s2>&1\s||\sprintf\s'verify=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval project_path_gateway_init\s/nonexistent/ppg\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'init=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval project_path_gateway_get\sA\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'get=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call eval printf\s'alive\\n'
status 0
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
out get=2
out verify=1
out init=2
out get=2
out alive
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned eval 0
op returned eval 0
op returned eval 0
op returned eval 0
op returned eval 0

case isolation-working-directory-options-and-traps-unchanged
caller-set -uf
caller-trap USR1 echo\st
cwd /t/루트\sroot/a\sb
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_get NOPE
call project_path_gateway_get
call project_path_gateway_verify
call project_path_gateway_verify extra more
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
status 0
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: NOPE
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 인자는 KEY 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 인자는 0개 또는 REPORT_FILE 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0

case isolation-caller-variables-unchanged
caller-ifs :
caller-var root v-root
caller-var key v-key
caller-var path v-path
caller-var line v-line
caller-var entry v-entry
caller-var dir v-dir
caller-var status v-status
caller-var file v-file
caller-var code v-code
caller-var first v-first
caller-var seen v-seen
caller-var lineno v-lineno
caller-var bad v-bad
caller-var records v-records
caller-var record v-record
caller-var tab v-tab
caller-var rest v-rest
caller-var result v-result
caller-var detail v-detail
caller-var start v-start
caller-var current v-current
caller-var count v-count
caller-var parent v-parent
caller-var name v-name
caller-var target v-target
caller-var physical v-physical
caller-var full v-full
caller-var passed v-passed
caller-var failed v-failed
caller-var message v-message
caller-var violation v-violation
caller-var cr v-cr
caller-var has_cr v-has_cr
caller-var other v-other
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_get NOPE
call project_path_gateway_get
call project_path_gateway_verify
call project_path_gateway_verify extra more
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
status 0
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: NOPE
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 인자는 KEY 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 인자는 0개 또는 REPORT_FILE 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0

case isolation-default-caller-results
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_get NOPE
call project_path_gateway_get
call project_path_gateway_verify
call project_path_gateway_verify extra more
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_verify
status 1
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: NOPE
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 인자는 KEY 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 인자는 0개 또는 REPORT_FILE 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1

case isolation-ifs-noglob-and-cdpath-do-not-change-results
fs dir /t/cdpath/relative
caller-ifs /
caller-set -f
env CDPATH /t/cdpath
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_get NOPE
call project_path_gateway_get
call project_path_gateway_verify
call project_path_gateway_verify extra more
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_verify
status 1
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: NOPE
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 인자는 KEY 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 인자는 0개 또는 REPORT_FILE 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 2
op returned project_path_gateway_get 2
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned project_path_gateway_verify 1

case isolation-nounset-does-not-change-results
caller-set -u
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_get NOPE
call project_path_gateway_get
call project_path_gateway_verify
call project_path_gateway_verify extra more
call project_path_gateway_init relative
call project_path_gateway_get A
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_verify
status 1
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 등록되지 않은 키입니다: NOPE
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 인자는 KEY 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
err project-path-gateway: 검증 실패 1건
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_verify: 인자는 0개 또는 REPORT_FILE 1개여야 합니다
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_init: 절대경로가 아닙니다: relative
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_get: 초기화되지 않았습니다. project_path_gateway_init을 먼저 호출하세요
err project-path-gateway: 누락: MISSING=nope
