# 다시 source하면 시스템 포트가 실제 구현으로 돌아가므로 같은 호출에서 대체물을 다시 적용한다.
case isolation-source-again-keeps-root
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call eval .\s"$PPGT_ROOT/lib/project-path-gateway.sh";\sppgt_vfs_apply
call project_path_gateway_get A
call eval printf\s'%s\\n'\s"$PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_ROOT"
call eval case\s"$(export\s-p)"\sin\s*PROJECT_PATH_GATEWAY_*)\sprintf\s'exported\\n'\s;;\sesac
status 0
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
out /t/루트 root
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op returned eval 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0
op returned eval 0
op returned eval 0

# 등록·갱신 격리 (기능 004 FR-041): 옵션·IFS·trap·작업 디렉터리·접두어 밖 변수가 바뀌지 않고(op changed 없음),
# 루트 변수는 op changed 비교 대상이 아니므로 마지막 조회 결과로 유지를 확인한다.
case isolation-edit-options-ifs-trap-cwd-and-root-kept
caller-set -euf
caller-ifs /
caller-trap USR1 echo\st
cwd /t/루트\sroot/a\sb
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR new
call eval project_path_gateway_add\sA\sx\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'add=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call project_path_gateway_update A a\sb/*
call project_path_gateway_update MISSING moved
call eval project_path_gateway_update\sNOPE\sx\s2>/dev/null\s||\sprintf\s'update=%s\\n'\s"$?"
call project_path_gateway_get A
status 0
out add=2
out update=2
out /t/루트 root/a b/*
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op copy-preserve /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A=a\sb/*\nMISSING=nope\nNEW_DIR=new\n
op move /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0
op returned eval 0
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0
op copy-preserve /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A=a\sb/*\nMISSING=moved\n
op move /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0
op returned eval 0
op returned project_path_gateway_get 0

case isolation-edit-caller-variables-unchanged
caller-var file keep-file
caller-var content keep-content
caller-var records keep-records
caller-var match keep-match
caller-var tab keep-tab
caller-var rest keep-rest
caller-var detail keep-detail
caller-var status keep-status
caller-var violation keep-violation
caller-var temp keep-temp
caller-var pid keep-pid
caller-var message keep-message
call project_path_gateway_init /t/루트\sroot
call project_path_gateway_add NEW_DIR new
call project_path_gateway_add A x
call project_path_gateway_update MISSING moved
call project_path_gateway_update bad x
call eval printf\s'%s\\n'\s"$file$content$records$match$tab$rest$detail$status$violation$temp$pid$message"
status 0
out keep-filekeep-contentkeep-recordskeep-matchkeep-tabkeep-restkeep-detailkeep-statuskeep-violationkeep-tempkeep-pidkeep-message
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_add: 이미 등록된 키입니다: A
err project-path-gateway: project_path_gateway_update: 키 형식이 잘못되었습니다(대문자로 시작, 대문자·숫자·_만 허용): bad
op returned project_path_gateway_init 0
op copy-preserve /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A=a\sb/*\nMISSING=nope\nNEW_DIR=new\n
op move /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_add 0
op returned project_path_gateway_add 2
op copy-preserve /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf
op write /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf A=a\sb/*\nMISSING=moved\n
op move /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/.ppg-tmp.4242.project-path-gateway.conf /t/루트\sroot/.tools/project-path-gateway/project-path-gateway.conf
op returned project_path_gateway_update 0
op returned project_path_gateway_update 2
op returned eval 0
